  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">ICJ. Internat. Commission of Jurists. Core support 2022-25</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">International Commission of Jurists (ICJ) Core Funding 2022-2025 to the implementation of ODA-relevant parts of ICJ&#x2019;s strategy, in line with ICJ&apos;s strategic goals: 1) Develop, defend, and strengthen international institutions, instruments and standards on rule of law and human rights, 2) Improve domestic implementation of, and compliance with, international law and standards, 3) Bolster the effectiveness and independence of judges and lawyers 4) Improve access to justice for all and accountability</narrative>
  </description>
